{
    "title": "myPennMedicine",
    "description": "The myPennMedicine app offers Penn Medicine patients easy, secure access to your personal medical records. An on-the-go connection to the information you need most: test results, referrals, prescribed medications and refill requests, appointment scheduling and more including syncing your Apple Health compatible tracking device to myPennMedicine. You can also communicate with your care team through secure messaging in the myPennMedicine app. Learn more at myPennMedicine.org.\r\n\r\nPenn Medicine hospitals are ranked among the top hospitals in the country by U.S. News & World Report and recognized as among the Philadelphia region\u2019s best health care. Learn more at PennMedicine.org.",
